    <string name="update_safe">If your phone shows a security warning or an "unknown app" message during the install, do not worry. This app is not in an official store, so Android shows that message for every app from outside a store. The file is downloaded from the official GitHub page of this project and installs over the current version with the same signature, so your settings are kept and nothing harms your phone. If the phone offers a scan and shows the "Install without scanning" option, you can tap that one without worry. The install is not forced: you can tap "Later".</string>
